  "title": "NASA Jets in the Pacific Airshow",
  "description": "NASA’s F/A‑18 and F‑15 aircraft, along with Administrator Jared Isaacman’s F‑5s, flew in the 2026 Pacific Airshow in Huntington Beach, California, from Friday through Sunday, Oct. 2-4. The flights showcased NASA’s aeronautics research capabilities during one of the nation’s largest aviation events. NASA also hosted an exhibit featuring elements of its Quesst mission, Artemis plans, and a model of the next Mars helicopter, SkyFall.",
